Language: {{language}}
File: {{filename}}
Block label: {{label}}
Block lines {{startLine}}–{{endLine}}:
```{{language}}
{{blockCode}}
```

Surrounding file context (for reference; do NOT explain it):
```{{language}}
{{fileContext}}
```

{{additionalContext}}
````

