Schema:
{
  "summary": "string",
  "pointsToConsider": {
    "assumptions": ["string"],
    "dangers": ["string"],
    "sideEffects": ["string"]
  },
  "concepts": [
    { "name": "string", "briefExplainer": "string", "relevance": "string" }
  ]
}

## Input
Language: {{language}}
File: {{filename}}
Block label: {{label}}
Block lines {{startLine}}–{{endLine}}:
```{{language}}
{{blockCode}}
```

Surrounding file context (for reference; do NOT explain it):
```{{language}}
{{fileContext}}
```

{{additionalContext}}
